WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.835 line:78%
Welcome back, Architect. Up to this point, you've reflected on your life.

00:00:04.885 --> 00:00:09.076 line:78%
You've made important decisions. You've established new standards.

00:00:09.126 --> 00:00:14.459 line:78%
Now it's time for something even more powerful. It's time to embrace a new identity.

00:00:14.509 --> 00:00:18.827 line:78%
The most lasting transformations don't happen because we try harder.

00:00:18.877 --> 00:00:22.559 line:78%
They happen because we begin to see ourselves differently.

00:00:22.609 --> 00:00:26.419 line:78%
You are no longer simply someone hoping for a better future.

00:00:26.469 --> 00:00:31.675 line:78%
You are becoming the Architect of your life. An Architect doesn't wait for change.

00:00:31.725 --> 00:00:34.138 line:78%
An Architect intentionally creates it.

00:00:34.188 --> 00:00:39.394 line:78%
As you move through this chapter, allow yourself to fully step into that identity.

00:00:39.444 --> 00:00:43.820 line:78%
Not someday. Beginning today. When you're ready... Let's begin Chapter Five.
